put THIS SCRIPT inside a Part containing a Decal:

local decal = script.Parent:WaitForChild("Decal")

while true do
	decal.Texture = "rbxassetid://IMAGE_ID_1"
	wait(5)

	decal.Texture = "rbxassetid://IMAGE_ID_2"
	wait(5)
end

change the Image IDs to your Roblox AssetIDs, and to add another Image simply just add this to the end:
  	decal.Texture = "rbxassetid://IMAGE_ID_NEW"
	  wait(5)

  or if you want to change the amount of time a slide/decal is visible, change the Wait(5) to Wait(your new amount IN SECONDS).

How do I upload an image?
create.roblox.com -> Creations -> Development items -> Decals -> Upload assets
After uploading, copy the ID that shows up and paste it into the IMAGE_ID_x in this script.
